970	band assisted pull-up	back	back	band	biceps	lats	{biceps,forearms}	Attach the band to a pull-up bar or sturdy anchor point. Step onto the band and grip the bar with your palms facing away from you, hands slightly wider than shoulder-width apart. Hang with your arms fully extended, keeping your core engaged and your shoulders down and back. Pull your body up towards the bar by squeezing your shoulder blades together and driving your elbows down towards your hips. Continue pulling until your chin is above the bar, then slowly lower yourself back down to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	Bandı bir çekme çubuğuna veya sağlam bir bağlantı noktasına takın. Grubun üzerine çıkın ve avuçlarınız sizden uzağa bakacak şekilde, eller omuz genişliğinden biraz daha açık olacak şekilde çubuğu kavrayın. Kollarınızı tamamen uzatarak asın, merkez bölgenizi meşgul ve omuzlarınızı aşağıda ve geride tutun. Kürek kemiklerinizi birbirine sıkıştırıp dirseklerinizi kalçalarınıza doğru iterek vücudunuzu bara doğru yukarı çekin. Çeneniz çubuğun üstüne çıkana kadar çekmeye devam edin, ardından yavaşça kendinizi başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna indirin. İstenilen sayıda tekrar için tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.855758+00	[-0.085063174,-0.022449477,-0.01971587,-0.001788356,-0.13177696,0.017102357,0.07480214,0.015209865,-0.04647611,-0.02039609,0.06062346,-0.06203256,0.01959385,-0.043394085,0.02638166,0.0510655,0.06698036,0.06548114,0.015754232,0.016034825,-0.04734902,0.054801293,0.021283777,0.0053840876,-0.02411705,-0.06658275,-0.061123043,0.011468221,-0.05208889,-0.082998954,-0.09910155,0.043744117,-0.030218419,0.02820838,-0.01845329,0.055714775,-0.027113108,0.027529504,-0.053525392,0.029733814,0.016363828,-0.077116996,0.010152089,-0.08632604,-0.05334315,0.059093922,-0.03625001,0.005380442,-0.0027185504,0.033152048,-0.0059348056,-0.12534596,-0.011795946,0.08268763,0.023326747,0.041970022,-0.013964764,-0.036926076,-0.023504881,0.039751433,0.042690556,0.022333488,-0