169	cable incline bench press	chest	chest	cable	deltoids	pectorals	{deltoids,triceps}	Adjust the bench to a 45-degree incline. Attach the cable handles to the high pulleys. Sit on the bench facing the cable machine with your feet flat on the ground. Grasp the handles with an overhand grip and bring them to shoulder height. Push the handles forward and upward until your arms are fully extended. Pause for a moment, then slowly lower the handles back to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	Tezgahı 45 derecelik bir eğime ayarlayın. Kablo tutamaklarını yüksek makaralara takın. Ayaklarınız yere düz basacak şekilde kablo makinesine bakan bankta oturun. Tutma yerlerini üstten kavrayarak omuz yüksekliğine getirin. Kollarınız tamamen uzayıncaya kadar kolları ileri ve yukarı doğru itin. Bir an duraklayın, ardından kolları yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna indirin. İstenilen sayıda tekrar için tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.874565+00	[-0.14076778,0.012529532,-0.038372725,-0.016912056,-0.07149803,0.017891703,-0.00017287399,0.01437474,-0.027886814,-0.004569462,0.053001024,-0.10513128,0.038093243,0.0006955067,0.02020552,0.058185473,0.008520716,0.05119785,0.028272046,-0.00017964756,-0.04759635,0.08095755,0.03609311,0.030082025,-0.101751335,-0.03190735,-0.054374374,0.008088874,-0.04954103,-0.11568077,-0.047581296,-0.059688482,0.028127186,0.056020744,0.009386635,0.07430307,-0.01610668,-0.030133424,-0.033643138,0.041171763,0.0325763,-0.07914092,-0.06065053,-0.018540189,0.0458738,0.10571821,-0.058754217,-0.0116966525,0.038141552,0.079867356,-0.08874872,-0.11048952,-0.026338598,0.083159596,0.026264751,0.04550152,-0.013247799,-0.018359805,-0.03959594,0.01119598,0.08015731,0.009712289,-0.014992478,0.039851204,-0.011979965,0.05988469,-0.045575697,-0.0033031383,0.013905239,-0.026894916,0.036516715,-0.029416919,-0.004330548,0.0008177099,0.009729471,-0.013722843,0.06017056,0.03932087,0.019566517,-0.0582513,-0.14388713,0.008747739,-0.068156965,-0.0098843975,-0.0