1263	cable one arm fly on exercise ball	chest	chest	cable	deltoids	pectorals	{deltoids,triceps}	Sit on an exercise ball with your feet flat on the ground and your back straight. Hold a cable handle in one hand and extend your arm out to the side, parallel to the ground. Keep your elbow slightly bent and your palm facing forward. Slowly bring your arm across your body, squeezing your chest muscles. Pause for a moment at the end of the movement, then slowly return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch sides.	Ayaklarınız yere düz basacak ve sırtınız düz olacak şekilde bir egzersiz topunun üzerine oturun. Bir elinizde bir kablo tutamağını tutun ve kolunuzu yere paralel olarak yana doğru uzatın. Dirseğinizi hafifçe bükülü ve avucunuzun ileriye dönük olmasını sağlayın. Kolunuzu yavaşça vücudunuzun üzerine getirin, göğüs kaslarınızı sıkın. Hareketin sonunda bir süre duraklayın ve ardından yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna dönün. İstenilen tekrar sayısı kadar tekrarlayın, ardından taraf değiştirin.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.875032+00	[-0.09456872,0.045308154,-0.019665267,-0.03692217,-0.045398436,-0.013810783,0.08084861,-0.00042369548,-0.038469676,0.017491499,0.07182604,-0.09352899,0.009493862,0.02026733,0.019039094,0.05627207,-0.004234245,0.032870386,-0.011701372,0.007984391,-0.015429623,0.08396861,0.05900192,0.025542997,-0.08149941,-0.039469354,-0.0064398176,0.012738875,-0.08203205,-0.15274656,-0.044756934,-0.013871633,-0.007819878,0.08498834,0.0038066641,0.04850268,-0.002287613,-0.026845405,-0.050149824,0.0058344333,0.060161166,-0.063926704,-0.01968786,-0.031695854,-0.030144632,0.14319198,-0.026513591,0.0006432717,0.04512252,0.11231894,-0.1085946,-0.10068902,-0.026287721,0.09637671,0.10681593,0.027630044,-0.053898603,-0.023165122,-0.072520584,-0.041557495,0.07823143,0.021933528,-0.0036612255,0.055168457,-0.04038975,0.0052903583,-0.029837852,-0.017507022,0.013488152,-0.06310293,0.032917988,-0.027691048,-0.033502724,0.041234143,-0.01243