1267	cable one arm press on exercise ball	chest	chest	cable	shoulders	pectorals	{shoulders,triceps}	Sit on an exercise ball with your feet flat on the ground and your back straight. Hold a cable handle in one hand and position your arm at chest height, elbow bent. Place your other hand on your hip for stability. Press the cable handle forward, extending your arm fully. Pause for a moment, then slowly return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch arms.	Ayaklarınız yere düz basacak ve sırtınız düz olacak şekilde bir egzersiz topunun üzerine oturun. Bir elinizde bir kablo tutacağını tutun ve kolunuzu göğüs hizasında, dirseğiniz bükülü olacak şekilde konumlandırın. Denge sağlamak için diğer elinizi kalçanıza yerleştirin. Kolunuzu tamamen uzatarak kablo tutamağını ileri doğru bastırın. Bir an duraklayın, ardından yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna dönün. İstenilen tekrar sayısı kadar tekrarlayın, ardından kolları değiştirin.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.875174+00	[-0.0912545,0.03032855,-0.021981556,-0.029466903,-0.05067838,0.0014105368,0.060356487,0.0061871395,-0.03878689,0.007039333,0.0724837,-0.0810969,0.036698177,0.028612327,0.018228307,0.023760475,-0.0049176067,0.019614859,0.023871494,0.008326312,-0.051938936,0.05687887,0.049779203,-0.015484473,-0.086086266,-0.036083255,-0.017249545,0.0058416915,-0.061077863,-0.12565982,-0.034549743,-0.05032402,0.011237389,0.09745199,-0.021788955,0.056334566,-0.009554622,-0.016918072,-0.04779838,0.028143669,0.04442901,-0.09919086,-0.028220212,-0.052951567,-0.0046132416,0.13524243,-0.021515455,-0.013645983,0.039518725,0.09926423,-0.11324509,-0.10824043,-0.013371659,0.054331943,0.08915383,0.032753073,-0.036079504,-0.01835977,-0.037655953,0.004647969,0.0838369,-0.015453051,-0.035060473,0.054443024,-0.037807513,0.025358394,-0.0018906719,0.029423753,0.0027189967,-0.055618323,0.038504012,-0.010874416,-0.05223423,0.029009765,0.017468134,0.004128658,0.033991348,0.0146419685,0.012068799,0.014855173,-0.15708345