230	cable standing lift	waist	waist	cable	obliques	abs	{obliques,"lower back"}	Stand facing the cable machine with your feet shoulder-width apart. Hold the cable handle with both hands and position it at waist height. Engage your core and maintain a straight back throughout the exercise. Keeping your arms straight, exhale and lift the cable handle up towards your opposite shoulder, rotating your torso. Pause for a moment at the top, then inhale and slowly lower the cable handle back to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch sides.	Ayaklarınız omuz genişliğinde açık olacak şekilde kablo makinesine dönük durun. Kablo tutamağını iki elinizle tutun ve bel hizasında konumlandırın. Merkez bölgenizi devreye sokun ve egzersiz boyunca düz bir sırtınızı koruyun. Kollarınızı düz tutarak nefes verin ve kablo tutamağını karşı omzunuza doğru kaldırarak gövdenizi döndürün. Tepede bir an duraklayın, ardından nefes alın ve kablo tutamağını yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna indirin. İstenilen tekrar sayısı kadar tekrarlayın, ardından taraf değiştirin.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.876332+00	[-0.09638256,-0.021854764,-0.04533847,0.017009472,-0.07407418,0.009508829,-0.0017056456,0.060167816,-0.081255585,-0.018287137,0.104299404,-0.059895404,0.039174546,0.014827993,-0.03368751,0.033804886,0.00045406987,0.047678493,0.00911009,0.0032231926,-0.03364741,0.024500983,0.0597138,0.028197546,-0.05665542,-0.053175665,-0.018699748,0.04090264,-0.038357843,-0.14014761,-0.07228634,-0.028716013,0.01713114,0.064511776,-0.017252281,0.038696956,0.022643827,-0.0065726275,-0.06446942,-0.009357753,0.004891274,-0.088453025,-0.03148726,-0.024256896,-0.023313839,0.055557612,0.027868055,-0.058034495,0.0027654627,0.05310393,-0.057384018,-0.09206606,-0.043850433,0.11766492,0.05732469,0.05633499,-0.07079732,-0.03134543,-0.010732232,0.0018578446,0.07590678,0.0036055092,-0.056394625,0.039292984,-0.06942279,0.05445709,-0.019864293,0.0053637004,-0.017088547,-0.016818607,0.031338077,-0.025