305	dumbbell decline shrug	back	back	dumbbell	shoulders	traps	{shoulders,rhomboids}	Set up a decline bench at a 45-degree angle. Lie face down on the bench with your chest and stomach resting against it. Hold a dumbbell in each hand with your arms fully extended towards the floor. Keeping your arms straight, raise your shoulders towards your ears as high as possible. Hold the contraction for a moment, then slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	45 derecelik bir açıyla bir düşüş tezgahı kurun. Göğsünüz ve karnınız ona yaslanacak şekilde bankta yüzüstü uzanın. Kollarınız yere doğru tamamen uzatılmış şekilde her iki elinizde birer dambıl tutun. Kollarınızı düz tutarak omuzlarınızı kulaklarınıza doğru mümkün olduğunca yukarı kaldırın. Bir süre kasılmayı sürdürün, ardından dambılları yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna indirin. İstenilen sayıda tekrar için tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.87821+00	[-0.07344081,-0.025924927,0.010879735,0.03304355,-0.09153612,0.00024844587,0.077733226,0.015497729,-0.055505823,-0.06219153,0.06579076,-0.04642485,0.044905297,-0.051887456,-0.05942583,0.05781916,0.019316943,0.088900864,0.005377885,0.018480679,-0.07271256,0.07383134,0.048736107,0.03895574,-0.08555396,-0.043157652,-0.05582475,0.01938858,-0.056404233,-0.123863585,-0.006161047,0.009444711,0.014194334,0.039345235,-0.0654558,0.05928313,-0.06891861,0.05183502,-0.0076559517,-0.010344324,-0.007353096,-0.034617487,0.0012098788,0.01990525,-0.042115577,0.06996777,-0.03629073,-0.0063601527,0.033347085,0.034337882,-0.02546485,-0.12773767,0.007457353,0.12269053,0.033503804,0.028554602,-0.09849431,-0.054366108,-0.033692483,0.05482911,0.02942716,-0.030964576,-0.01852044,0.0024438149,-0.043083996,0.043940794,0.001938115,-0.020719316,0.018196732,-0.04279199,0.055012792,-0.027458271,-0.02834007,0.023160119,0.041115724,-0.03514613,0.06915684,-0.012458078,0.05778726,0.025539974,-0.1199567,-0.009672722,-0.075711675,-0.012849921,-0.021570502