1283	dumbbell incline press on exercise ball	chest	chest	dumbbell	shoulders	pectorals	{shoulders,triceps}	Sit on an exercise ball with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward. Slowly walk your feet forward, rolling your body down the ball until your head, neck, and upper back are supported on the ball. Hold the dumbbells at shoulder level, elbows bent and pointing out to the sides. Press the dumbbells upward, extending your arms fully. Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	Her iki elinizde birer dambıl olacak şekilde, avuç içleriniz öne bakacak şekilde bir egzersiz topunun üzerine oturun. Ayaklarınızı yavaşça ileri doğru yürütün; başınız, boynunuz ve sırtınızın üst kısmı top üzerinde desteklenene kadar vücudunuzu topun aşağısına doğru yuvarlayın. Dambılları omuz hizasında tutun, dirsekler bükülü ve yanlara doğru baksın. Kollarınızı tamamen uzatarak dambılları yukarı doğru bastırın. Tepe noktasında bir süre duraklayın, ardından dambılları yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna indirin. İstenilen sayıda tekrar için tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.878866+00	[-0.089685105,0.0070319944,-0.03463542,-0.019199727,-0.096732765,0.02524618,0.019674754,-0.004119225,-0.025210679,-0.02090164,0.04749184,-0.04248358,0.045488656,-0.046806276,0.045172427,0.04568761,0.020905845,0.04660906,0.045690317,-0.021897234,-0.06841679,0.057286244,0.049819145,0.03283857,-0.11467887,0.0014861006,-0.02931665,0.03483328,-0.051267553,-0.10162998,-0.021588651,-0.05325267,0.021374403,0.0659177,-0.028766645,0.052245956,-0.06898814,0.047402434,0.00041514143,0.0050202115,-0.006007371,-0.094925195,-0.0235506,-0.0065656174,0.016107496,0.13922422,-0.025593244,-0.006141612,0.033080988,0.0694644,-0.061295982,-0.130258,0.02337296,0.040431783,0.045473546,0.045711953,-0.016332354,-0.006093337,-0.04199215,0.035847157,0.033918466,-0.02943933,-0.02626167,0.041057967,-0.052555103,0.04354826,-0.045698427,0.0043677143