1742	dumbbell tricep kickback with stork stance	upper arms	upper arms	dumbbell	shoulders	triceps	{shoulders}	Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and hold a dumbbell in your right hand. Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the hips, keeping your back straight. Bring your right elbow up to your side, keeping it bent at a 90-degree angle. Extend your right arm straight back, squeezing your triceps. Pause for a moment, then slowly lower the dumbbell back to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch sides.	Ayaklarınızı omuz genişliğinde açın ve sağ elinizde bir dambıl tutun. Dizlerinizi hafifçe bükün ve sırtınızı düz tutarak kalçalarınızdan öne doğru eğilin. Sağ dirseğinizi 90 derecelik bir açıyla bükerek yanınıza getirin. Trisepsinizi sıkarak sağ kolunuzu düz bir şekilde geriye doğru uzatın. Bir an duraklayın, ardından dambılı yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna indirin. İstenilen tekrar sayısı kadar tekrarlayın, ardından taraf değiştirin.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.882382+00	[-0.12209645,0.012810523,-0.076518595,0.0015686476,-0.099765144,0.02825212,0.076312155,0.010570705,-0.056089338,-0.03394939,0.09287606,-0.029562978,0.037970707,-0.05921263,-0.01121938,0.028572071,0.022505604,0.08488415,0.024360169,-0.0055634524,-0.085367404,0.040058024,0.022715641,0.037849247,-0.10293866,-0.02029054,-0.03848111,0.00044519993,-0.052538686,-0.14251257,0.004633973,-0.006423395,-0.037613153,0.031991553,-0.025477031,0.07684001,-0.077024624,0.025604498,-0.03023053,0.011469075,-0.019521706,-0.07216637,-0.03262452,-0.047550146,0.005383959,0.13395286,0.012750188,-0.014006949,0.041871447,0.01928412,-0.019723363,-0.12555812,0.027134066,0.071811095,0.042504963,0.04168608,-0.027606314,-0.023688767,-0.022808738,0.064028196,0.07535567,0.019873472,-0.028315792,-0.0046773464,-0.047556505,0.059036262,0.0057321987,-0.07379956,0.024855183,-0.048115157,0.053841963,-0.018312383,0.0021656724,-0.0040796804,0.0018896012,-0.002716747,0.09111081,0.036536865,0.060337