1342	exercise ball lying side lat stretch	back	back	stability ball	shoulders	lats	{shoulders,triceps}	Lie on your side with your legs extended and your head supported by the stability ball. Place your top arm on the ball for stability. Reach your top arm overhead and allow your torso to rotate slightly. Feel the stretch in your lat muscles on the side of your body. Hold the stretch for 20-30 seconds, then switch sides and repeat.	Bacaklarınız uzatılmış ve başınız denge topu tarafından desteklenmiş şekilde yan tarafınıza uzanın. Denge için üst kolunuzu topun üzerine yerleştirin. Üst kolunuzu başınızın üzerine kaldırın ve gövdenizin hafifçe dönmesine izin verin. Vücudunuzun yan tarafındaki lat kaslarınızdaki gerginliği hissedin. Uzatmayı 20-30 saniye kadar tutun, ardından tarafları değiştirin ve tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.882821+00	[-0.044874158,0.0057469355,-0.039876748,-0.024441838,-0.04202874,0.017948417,0.04356112,0.058802705,-0.044742826,-0.023428109,0.07295419,-0.04577143,0.016634202,-0.028196722,0.04001095,0.02920464,-0.011908614,0.060349714,0.014993961,-0.020558544,-0.033764284,0.04910764,0.045087226,-0.0061437557,-0.10277468,0.021369698,0.0014648744,0.00815725,-0.08233497,-0.13305515,-0.06975029,0.013244278,-0.045236386,0.06133439,0.0065635038,0.046203304,-0.062437203,-0.004368399,0.013301991,0.011472631,-0.02464128,-0.104516685,-0.0004233226,-0.012717547,-0.00011371714,0.11753632,-0.0409098,0.01902088,0.006823509,0.0564205,-0.03490871,-0.12704653,-0.019007633,0.053140603,0.02069634,0.0353734,-0.05760398,0.033872664,-0.030945517,0.033782866,0.09719194,0.013966553,-0.004829971,0.01958336,-0.05717135,-0.013917304,-0.019905152,0.011202238,-0.013782074,-0.03255645,0.040680673,0.013521042,-0.06422132,-0.018709386,0.011978913,-0.015608104,0.08090775,0.0019818407,-0.008779533,-0.022686359,-0.06690336,-0.0092886,-0.07247842,0.0066990196,-0.026420664,0.049039792,-0.011777019,0.030396763,-0.016162235,-0.018394707,-0.022161001,-0.019759223,0.032748085,0.057090323,