534	kettlebell goblet squat	upper legs	upper legs	kettlebell	quadriceps	glutes	{quadriceps,hamstrings,calves}	Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, holding a kettlebell close to your chest with both hands. Keeping your chest up and core engaged, lower your body down into a squat position by bending at the knees and hips. Continue lowering until your thighs are parallel to the ground, or as low as you can comfortably go. Pause for a moment at the bottom, then push through your heels to return to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	Ayaklarınızı omuz genişliğinde açın ve kettlebell'i iki elinizle göğsünüze yakın tutun. Göğsünüzü yukarıda ve göbek bölgenizi kapalı tutarak, dizlerinizi ve kalçalarınızı bükerek vücudunuzu çömelme pozisyonuna indirin. Uyluklarınız yere paralel veya rahatça gidebileceğiniz kadar alçalana kadar alçaltmaya devam edin. Altta bir an duraklayın, ardından başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna dönmek için topuklarınızı itin. İstenilen sayıda tekrar için tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.885238+00	[-0.0843674,-0.016882401,-0.041560635,0.008889825,-0.15689574,-0.03179606,0.07548216,-0.00018902312,-0.046215016,-0.094869435,0.041897498,-0.023314696,0.024851877,-0.013158699,-0.012241155,-0.013973191,0.012531897,0.06951136,-0.01452199,-0.07763662,-0.040220056,0.05611318,0.07450765,0.02129205,-0.03207811,0.04370325,-0.04919305,0.03942541,-0.020796342,-0.07284176,-0.11433043,-0.03429149,-0.075306974,0.0393252,-0.004695166,0.043559738,-0.04347614,-0.0054610604,-0.00722908,-0.013032567,0.020984678,-0.08418582,-0.023034245,-0.010857571,-0.008055616,0.1725875,0.0025542376,-0.049139585,0.0004859924,-0.019518627,-0.010559707,-0.098929994,0.042379647,0.104978465,0.052327726,-0.00601773,-0.049889795,-0.015079906,-0.0035622816,0.053351272,0.0019345642,0.07555211,-0.053346857,0.040702827,-0.021113079,0.026404701,-0.06076104,0.00193193,0.004800893,0.010864423,0.065819204,-0.030595096,-0.050746694,0.0292154,-0.0107674245,0.006812475,0.06426483,