541	kettlebell one arm row	back	back	kettlebell	biceps	upper back	{biceps,forearms}	Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, holding a kettlebell in one hand with an overhand grip. Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the hips, keeping your back straight and your core engaged. Pull the kettlebell up towards your chest, keeping your elbow close to your body and squeezing your shoulder blades together. Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the kettlebell back down to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch sides and repeat with the other arm.	Ayaklarınızı omuz genişliğinde açın ve bir elinizde kettlebell'i üstten kavrayarak tutun. Dizlerinizi hafifçe bükün ve kalçalarınızdan öne doğru eğilin, sırtınızı düz ve merkez bölgenizi meşgul tutun. Dirseğinizi vücudunuza yakın tutarak ve kürek kemiklerinizi birbirine sıkıştırarak kettlebell'i göğsünüze doğru yukarı çekin. Tepe noktasında bir süre duraklayın, ardından kettlebell'i yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna indirin. İstenilen tekrar sayısı kadar tekrarlayın, ardından taraf değiştirin ve diğer kolla tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.885399+00	[-0.09255626,-0.015286504,-0.037524004,-0.008006695,-0.15248916,0.0069552977,0.072057016,-0.037453476,-0.027409855,-0.061725643,0.046222307,-0.10979253,0.050874542,-0.050442632,-0.021361053,0.023238104,0.014316079,0.066807434,0.008611679,-0.0043569915,-0.08306969,0.03247168,0.047463138,-0.005240299,-0.0010677092,0.035380527,-0.05700468,0.048860878,-0.042743083,-0.100641035,-0.0894044,0.0061043208,-0.058601853,0.07612862,-0.009957343,0.057230376,-0.059449967,0.023292804,-0.020026306,-0.017079467,0.054041587,-0.03379996,-0.016964752,-0.009372445,0.0006258165,0.09868986,-0.008892671,-0.05400883,0.027724471,-0.0010698631,-0.022615315,-0.11502253,0.039065674,0.06173635,0.056300823,-0.005488437,-0.000120682125,-0.0254872,-0.053799044,0.11331712,-0.0045197336,0.03364005,-0.052145112,0.01569253,0.013687856,-0.015764887,-0.0623761,0.