597	lever seated hip abduction	upper legs	upper legs	leverage machine	glutes	abductors	{glutes,hamstrings}	Adjust the seat height so that your knees are at a 90-degree angle. Sit on the machine with your back against the backrest and your feet on the footrests. Place your hands on the side handles for stability. Engage your abductors and slowly push your legs apart, away from the midline of your body. Pause for a moment at the end of the movement, then slowly bring your legs back together to the starting position. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	Koltuk yüksekliğini dizleriniz 90 derecelik bir açıda olacak şekilde ayarlayın. Sırtınız koltuk arkalığına dayalı ve ayaklarınız ayaklıkların üzerinde olacak şekilde makineye oturun. Dengeyi sağlamak için ellerinizi yan tutamakların üzerine koyun. Kaçıranlarınızı devreye sokun ve bacaklarınızı yavaşça vücudunuzun orta hattından uzağa doğru itin. Hareketin sonunda bir süre duraklayın ve ardından bacaklarınızı yavaşça başlangıç ​​pozisyonuna getirin. İstenilen sayıda tekrar için tekrarlayın.	2026-03-18 12:31:32.887024+00	[-0.07423371,0.0035119585,-0.026912304,-0.0035034057,-0.12224019,-0.056307293,0.07587832,0.009769402,-0.039729107,-0.03672303,0.033752333,-0.00050314533,0.071141146,-0.024499325,-0.04368963,0.022557147,-0.0022103086,0.04385822,-0.040920433,-0.01076965,-0.038982745,0.016894177,0.030338073,0.0052886084,-0.039829776,-0.05543823,-0.047460523,0.048228502,-0.0145090055,-0.09123977,-0.10041813,-0.012152586,0.021387344,0.032583665,0.074615754,0.06426886,-0.053614292,-0.027048742,-0.024341585,-0.044309247,0.022893507,-0.0894138,-0.016130334,-0.041174624,0.018070398,0.13374828,-0.055655345,-0.026410976,0.021113036,0.06981071,-0.053801145,-0.1149781,0.021987645,0.11102674,-0.01423762,0.0058413185,-0.06797622,-0.07240666,-0.027941288,-0.01568003,0.021148425,0.026573436,-0.07606835,0.036553193,-0.0769224,0.0072612828,0.008935507,-0.020130932,0.0057278015,0.0074308366,0.052528106,-0.025006197,-0.071879186,0.04